# Allow-list: the build context is backend/, and only what the runtime needs gets in.
# Anything not re-included below (tests, caches, .env, keys, local venvs, docs) never reaches the image.
*
!app/
!migrations/
!scripts/
!requirements.txt
!requirements.lock
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/service-account*.json
